---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'National Research Platform Fall Training',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="py-16 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-6">National Research Platform Fall Training</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-100 mb-4 font-bold">September 2nd to September 30th, 2025</p>
      
      <!-- Next Sessions Notice -->
      <div class="bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900 border-2 border-yellow-400 dark:border-yellow-600 rounded-lg p-6 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-200 mb-4">NEXT SESSION - Tuesday, September 23</h2>
        <div class="text-lg text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-100 mb-4">
          <div class="mb-3">
            <p><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong> - Deploying JupyterHub and Coder</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300 ml-4">Session runs from 10:00 AM to 11:00 AM Pacific (1:00 PM to 2:00 PM Eastern)</p>
            <p class="mt-1"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/95336469365" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900 border-2 border-red-400 dark:border-red-600 rounded-lg p-4">
          <p class="text-xl font-bold text-red-800 dark:text-red-200 mb-2">IMPORTANT: NAMESPACE REQUIREMENT</p>
          <p class="text-lg text-red-700 dark:text-red-100 font-bold">USERS MUST BE PART OF A NAMESPACE/GROUP BEFORE THE SESSIONS TO FOLLOW ALONG. USERS WHO AREN'T WON'T BE ABLE TO PARTICIPATE EFFECTIVELY.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-8">Join us for a month-long series of workshops, tutorials, and hands-on sessions designed to help you get started with the NRP, accelerate your research, and connect with the community. Whether you're a new user or an experienced researcher, there's something for everyone!</p>
      <a href="#schedule" class="inline-block bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg shadow transition">View Training Schedule</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4">About the Training</h2>
      <p class="mb-2">You do not need to attend every session—choose based on your role and interests. <span class="font-bold text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-300">All are welcome to attend any or all sessions.</span></p>
      <div class="mb-2">
        <span class="font-bold">Time:</span>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-4">
          <li>First Session: 10:00 AM PDT / 1:00 PM EDT</li>
          <li>Second Session: 11:00 AM PDT / 2:00 PM EDT</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-4">
        <span class="font-bold">Note:</span> Each session has its own Zoom link. See the schedule below for specific links.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4">Session Table</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="min-w-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-sm md:text-base rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <thead class="bg-blue-200 dark:bg-slate-700 text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Session Title</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Description</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Beginner User</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Accustomed User</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">NS Admin / PI</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Instructor</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800">
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Introduction to the National Research Platform <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Overview of NRP's mission, capabilities, how to gain access, and policy guidelines.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">The Portal: GUI Access to Resources <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Navigate the NRP portal, manage namespaces/groups, and explore the integrated LiteLLM interface.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Using JupyterHub and Coder as a User <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Launch and use interactive development environments. Ideal for researchers, students, and educators.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Basic Docker and Kubernetes <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Foundations of containers and orchestration: Pods, Deployments, PVCs, and S3 storage.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Intermediate Kubernetes <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Scripting with kubectl, exposing services, using taints/tolerations, node affinity, and Python APIs.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Agentic Tools and Coding with AI/LLMs <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Explore how to integrate NRP-managed LMs and AI agents into JupyterHub, Coder and your own namespace.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Deploying JupyterHub and Coder</td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Learn how to deploy and manage JupyterHub and Coder environments for groups or courses.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Advanced I: GitLab CI/CD and Custom Images</td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Use GitLab pipelines to automate image building and deploy custom JupyterHub setups.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Advanced II: VMs, Windows Access, and Edge Use Cases</td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Launch and connect to VMs (Linux/Windows), configure networking, and explore advanced edge scenarios.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="schedule" class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4">Schedule</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="min-w-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-sm md:text-base rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <thead class="bg-blue-200 dark:bg-slate-700 text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Date</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Time (Pacific / Eastern)</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Session Title</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Zoom Link</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 2</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Introduction to the National Research Platform</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/95251971801" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">The Portal: GUI Access to Resources</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/91558273595" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 9</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Using JupyterHub and Coder as a User</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/92728984788" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Basic Docker and Kubernetes</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/94308786130" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 16</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Intermediate Kubernetes</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/96377381436" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Agentic Tools and Coding with AI/LLMs</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/96377381436" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top">Tuesday, September 23</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Deploying JupyterHub and Coder</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/95336469365" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 30</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Advanced I: GitLab CI/CD and Custom Images</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/94806123775" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Advanced II: VMs, Windows, and Edge Use Cases</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://ucsd.zoom.us/j/92476867994" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Session</a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Resources Section -->
      <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4">Training Materials & Recordings</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 mb-2">Video Recordings</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-3">All session recordings are available on our YouTube playlist:</p>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" 
               class="inline-block bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded text-sm transition" 
               target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              Watch on YouTube
            </a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 mb-2">Code & Slides</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-3">All code examples, slides, and materials are posted to our GitHub repository:</p>
            <a href="https://github.com/nrp-nautilus/fall25training" 
               class="inline-block bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded text-sm transition" 
               target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              View on GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-sm text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-200">
            <strong>Note:</strong> Zoom links above are for live sessions only. For recordings and materials, use the YouTube playlist and GitHub repository links above.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
